 also displays when that [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bead was created, rendered through one shared presentation module [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]so the glyph, color, wording, and timezone are identical [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]everywhere, and so persisted or content-validated surfaces stay [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]byte-stable.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bead_create_time.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/bead_create_time.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-fc[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-fc/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared bead time presentation module[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]presentation[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]presentation: add src/sase/bead_time_presentation.py as the single [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source of bead instant and age rendering (glyphs, teal accent, absolute [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]labels, compact age labels, Rich chips, ANSI CLI cells), with honest [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placeholders for unparseable values and a patchable clock indirection, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bead CLI detail, list, search, and dependency surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after presentation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add a CREATED section to sase bead show, a created-age cell to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compact list and search rows, and created context to dependency [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list/tree rows, then pin the test clock and regenerate the affected CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]golden files.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task triage gate payload, preview, and validation[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after presentation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate: thread the bead created_at through the TaskTriage gate payload, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notification note, and Markdown preview using absolute-only rendering, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend the strict payload and preview-reconstruction validation to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]match, and add created_at to the chop presentation fingerprint.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]BEAD lane in the SASE CONTEXT agent metadata panel[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]context_lane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after presentation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]context_lane: add created_at to BeadSummary and both summary builders, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render a trailing Created row in the BEAD lane for task and phase beads,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register the new module with the visual-snapshot clock pin, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]regenerate the affected PNG snapshots.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ACE Beads pane rows, detail pane, and reference completion[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace_panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after presentation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace_panel: replace the ambiguous single age on Beads pane rows with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]explicit created and updated cells, move the detail pane and preview [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]M